      "body": "Concept ACK\r\n\r\nNow that #34075 is merged, we can also move its cache in there, i.e cache the block template based on time and tip changes. This brings us multiple advantages\r\n\r\ni) We consolidate the block template caching for the RPC and fees to the block template manager for better code organisation and reuse.\r\nii) The mempool fee rate estimator's reliance on the chainstate manager is reduced; the only dependence after that will be on the chain tip, which can also be removed by using chain tip change validation signals. After that, the mempool fee rate estimator will be independent of the mempool and chainstate manager, in replacement with block template manager.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
